    },
    "This clears the Run History list only. Your videos, feed, and statistics are kept. This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Isso limpa só a lista do Histórico de atualizações. Seus vídeos, feed e estatísticas são mantidos. Não dá para desfazer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes the collection, its %lld sources, its email recipients, its run history and every video and post it found, including ones you saved. It can't be undone. Your accounts on YouTube, X and the other platforms aren't touched." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
